{"query":"Search for the actual federal subpoena or court filing (e.g., in the Hunter Biden tax/gun cases) that documents FBI seizure or custody of the laptop, with dates and custodian names.","results":[{"position":1,"site_name":"pacer.uscourts.gov","snippet":"Anyone can access PACER to view federal court records, but first you need to register for a PACER account. Case information is available through PACER 24 hours a day, including weekends and holidays. Each court maintains its own case information. If you know the district or circuit in which the case is filed, search that court directly.","title":"Find a Case | PACER: Federal Court Records","url":"https://pacer.uscourts.gov/find-case"},{"position":2,"site_name":"www.uscourts.gov","snippet":"The main type of record the federal courts create and maintain is a case file, which contains a docket sheet and all documents filed in a case. Case files and court records can be found on PACER.uscourts.gov.","title":"Court Records - United States Courts","url":"https://www.uscourts.gov/court-records"},{"position":3,"site_name":"vault.fbi.gov","snippet":"The Vault is our new FOIA Library, containing 6,700 documents and other media that have been scanned from paper into digital copies so you can read them in the comfort of your home or office.","title":"FBI — Federal Bureau of Investigation","url":"https://vault.fbi.gov/search"},{"date":"Jun 20, 2023","position":4,"site_name":"www.courtlistener.com","snippet":"Docket for United States v. Biden, 1:23-cr-00061 — Brought to you by Free Law Project, a non-profit dedicated to creating high quality open legal information.","title":"United States v. Biden, 1:23-cr-00061 – CourtListener.com","url":"https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/67511701/united-states-v-biden/"},{"date":"Oct 29, 2026","position":5,"site_name":"unicourt.com","snippet":"Search federal court records online from U.S. appellate, circuit, district, bankruptcy courts, and the PACER Case Locator for free. Lookup federal court cases by name, case number, party, attorney, judge, case type, docket entry & more.","title":"Federal Court Records | PACER Case Search - UniCourt","url":"https://unicourt.com/courts/federal"},{"position":6,"site_name":"www.justice.gov","snippet":"In June 2019, the Defendant’s ex-wife brought a motion to enforce a marital separation agreement between herself and the Defendant in the Superior Court of the District of Columbia (“D.C. Superior Court”) because the Defendant had stopped making spousal support payments and refused to provide financial records, including his tax returns ...","title":"UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE CENTRAL DISTRICT OF ...","url":"https://www.justice.gov/d9/2023-12/rhb_indictment.pdf"},{"date":"Oct 22, 2020","position":7,"site_name":"www.foxnews.com","snippet":"The FBI’s subpoena of a laptop and hard drive purportedly belonging to Hunter Biden came in connection with a money laundering investigation in late 2019, according to documents obtained by Fox ...","title":"Laptop connected to Hunter Biden linked to FBI money ...","url":"https://www.foxnews.com/politics/laptop-hunter-biden-linked-fbi-money-laundering-probe"}],"total_results":7,"page":0}